c0=b8?"The next step after X-cross: build two F2L pairs during the cross.":"B\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u1ebfp theo c\u1ee7a X-cross: g\u1ed9p 2 c\u1eb7p F2L v\xe0o l\xfac l\xe0m d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng."
