r=b8?"Easiest when the two pairs belong to ADJACENT slots and the cross edge between them is already in place: you are really building a 2\xd72\xd73 block.":"D\u1ec5 l\xe0m nh\u1ea5t khi 2 c\u1eb7p thu\u1ed9c 2 khe K\u1ec0 nhau v\xe0 c\u1ea1nh d\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng gi\u1eefa ch\xfang \u0111\xe3 n\u1eb1m s\u1eb5n: th\u1ef1c ch\u1ea5t l\xe0 d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed9t kh\u1ed1i 2\xd72\xd73."
