o=b8?"Efficient F2L: pick pairs, no rotations":"F2L hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3: ch\u1ecdn c\u1eb7p, kh\xf4ng xoay cube"
n=b8?"Cut moves and pauses in F2L \u2013 half of your solve time.":"Gi\u1ea3m s\u1ed1 b\u01b0\u1edbc v\xe0 s\u1ed1 l\u1ea7n d\u1eebng \u1edf F2L \u2013 ph\u1ea7n chi\u1ebfm n\u1eeda th\u1eddi gian gi\u1ea3i."
m=b8?"No fixed order: each time pick the EASIEST pair (visible in the top layer, fewest moves).":"Kh\xf4ng l\xe0m theo th\u1ee9 t\u1ef1 c\u1ed1 \u0111\u1ecbnh: m\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n ch\u1ecdn c\u1eb7p D\u1ec4 nh\u1ea5t (\u0111\xe3 l\u1ed9 ra \u1edf t\u1ea7ng tr\xean, \xedt b\u01b0\u1edbc nh\u1ea5t)."
l=b8?"Insert into back slots with R' U' R or L U L' instead of rotating y2 (see lesson F2L 4).":"Ch\xe8n v\xe0o khe sau b\u1eb1ng R' U' R ho\u1eb7c L U L' thay v\xec xoay y2 (xem b\xe0i F2L 4)."
k=b8?"Pair at the back of the top layer: turn U to bring it forward \u2013 a U turn beats a cube rotation.":"C\u1eb7p \u1edf m\u1eb7t sau t\u1ea7ng tr\xean: xoay U \u0111\u01b0a ra tr\u01b0\u1edbc r\u1ed3i m\u1edbi x\u1eed l\xfd \u2013 U nhanh h\u01a1n xoay c\u1ea3 cube."
j=b8?"Use an empty slot to set up a pair: an unsolved slot can be used to split/join instead of a long sequence.":"D\xf9ng khe tr\u1ed1ng \u0111\u1ec3 gh\xe9p c\u1eb7p: n\u1ebfu m\u1ed9t khe ch\u01b0a l\xe0m, c\xf3 th\u1ec3 d\xf9ng n\xf3 \u0111\u1ec3 t\xe1ch/gh\xe9p thay cho b\u01b0\u1edbc r\u01b0\u1eddm r\xe0."
