i5=$.c==="en"?"The most basic move, used to warm up":"\u0110\u1ed9ng t\xe1c c\u01a1 b\u1ea3n nh\u1ea5t, d\xf9ng \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u1edfi \u0111\u1ed9ng"
