i7=$.c==="en"
i8=i7?"Step 1: White cross":"B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: D\u1ea5u c\u1ed9ng tr\u1eafng"
i9=i7?"4 white edges on the bottom face, their other colour matching the side centre.":"4 c\u1ea1nh tr\u1eafng \u1edf m\u1eb7t d\u01b0\u1edbi, m\xe0u c\xf2n l\u1ea1i tr\xf9ng v\u1edbi t\xe2m b\xean c\u1ea1nh."
j0=i7?"Top layer, white facing up: turn U until the other colour matches the centre below, then turn that face twice (e.g. F2).":"T\u1ea7ng tr\xean, tr\u1eafng h\u01b0\u1edbng l\xean: xoay U \u0111\u1ebfn khi m\xe0u c\xf2n l\u1ea1i tr\xf9ng t\xe2m b\xean d\u01b0\u1edbi, r\u1ed3i xoay m\u1eb7t \u0111\xf3 2 l\u1ea7n (vd F2)."
j1=i7?"Top layer, white facing out: turn U so the edge is in front with its top colour matching the front centre, then do U' R' F R.":"T\u1ea7ng tr\xean, tr\u1eafng h\u01b0\u1edbng ra ngo\xe0i: xoay U \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1ea1nh \u1edf m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\xe0 m\xe0u ph\xeda tr\xean c\u1ee7a n\xf3 tr\xf9ng t\xe2m m\u1eb7t tr\u01b0\u1edbc, r\u1ed3i l\xe0m U' R' F R."
j2=i7?"Middle layer (between front and right): do R U R' to bring it to the top, then handle it as above.":"T\u1ea7ng gi\u1eefa (gi\u1eefa tr\u01b0\u1edbc v\xe0 ph\u1ea3i): l\xe0m R U R' \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a l\xean t\u1ea7ng tr\xean, r\u1ed3i x\u1eed l\xfd nh\u01b0 tr\xean."
j0=A.a([j0,j1,j2,i7?"On the bottom but wrong: turn that face twice to bring it up, then handle it again.":"\u1ede d\u01b0\u1edbi nh\u01b0ng sai: xoay m\u1eb7t \u0111\xf3 2 l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a l\xean, r\u1ed3i x\u1eed l\xfd l\u1ea1i."],s)
i7=$.c==="en"
j1=i7?"White edge facing out":"C\u1ea1nh tr\u1eafng h\u01b0\u1edbng ra ngo\xe0i"
i7=i7?"Bring up a middle-layer edge":"\u0110\u01b0a c\u1ea1nh t\u1ea7ng gi\u1eefa l\xean"
