g=j?"Turn U until at least 2 edges match their centres.":"Xoay U \u0111\u1ebfn khi c\xf3 \xedt nh\u1ea5t 2 c\u1ea1nh tr\xf9ng m\xe0u t\xe2m."
f=j?"2 correct edges next to each other: put them at the back and right, do the algorithm.":"2 c\u1ea1nh \u0111\xfang k\u1ec1 nhau: \u0111\u1eb7t ch\xfang \u1edf sau v\xe0 ph\u1ea3i, l\xe0m c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c."
g=A.a([g,f,j?"2 correct edges opposite each other: do the algorithm once from any angle and you'll get the adjacent case.":"2 c\u1ea1nh \u0111\xfang \u0111\u1ed1i di\u1ec7n: l\xe0m c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c 1 l\u1ea7n t\u1eeb h\u01b0\u1edbng b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3, s\u1ebd ra tr\u01b0\u1eddng h\u1ee3p k\u1ec1 nhau."],s)
j=A.a([new A.aX("yedges",$.c==="en"?"Swap yellow edges":"\u0110\u1ed5i c\u1ea1nh v\xe0ng","R U R' U R U2 R' U","")],i6)
f=$.c==="en"
e=f?"Step 6: Yellow corners in place":"B\u01b0\u1edbc 6: G\xf3c v\xe0ng \u0111\xfang ch\u1ed7"
d=f?"Every corner in its correct spot (it has all 3 colours of the centres around it), not necessarily twisted right yet.":"M\u1ed7i g\xf3c n\u1eb1m \u0111\xfang ch\u1ed7 (c\xf3 \u0111\u1ee7 3 m\xe0u c\u1ee7a 3 t\xe2m quanh n\xf3), ch\u01b0a c\u1ea7n \u0111\xfang h\u01b0\u1edbng."
c=f?"Find one corner in the correct spot and put it at top-front-right.":"T\xecm 1 g\xf3c \u0111\xfang ch\u1ed7, \u0111\u1eb7t n\xf3 \u1edf tr\xean-tr\u01b0\u1edbc-ph\u1ea3i."
b=f?"Do the algorithm 1\u20132 times until all 4 corners are in place.":"L\xe0m c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c 1\u20132 l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ebfn khi 4 g\xf3c \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\xfang ch\u1ed7."
c=A.a([c,b,f?"No corner in place yet: do it once from any angle, then look again.":"Ch\u01b0a c\xf3 g\xf3c n\xe0o \u0111\xfang ch\u1ed7: l\xe0m 1 l\u1ea7n \u1edf h\u01b0\u1edbng b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 r\u1ed3i t\xecm l\u1ea1i."],s)
