e4=d9?"White up \xb7 2":"Tr\u1eafng l\xean \xb7 2"
d9=d9?"White up \xb7 3":"Tr\u1eafng l\xean \xb7 3"
d9=A.a([new A.aX("f2l_up1",e3,"U R U2 R' U R U' R'",""),new A.aX("f2l_up2",e4,"U2 R U R' U R U' R'",""),new A.aX("f2l_up3",d9,"U' F' U2 F U' F' U F","")],i6)
e3=$.c==="en"
e4=e3?"F2L 3: Pieces stuck in the slot":"F2L 3: M\u1ea3nh k\u1eb9t trong khe"
e5=e3?"The corner is already below the slot, or the edge is stuck in the slot.":"G\xf3c n\u1eb1m s\u1eb5n d\u01b0\u1edbi khe, ho\u1eb7c c\u1ea1nh k\u1eb9t trong khe."
e6=e3?"Corner below the slot, edge in the top layer: bring the edge to the right spot, then insert with one of the first three algorithms.":"G\xf3c d\u01b0\u1edbi khe, c\u1ea1nh \u1edf t\u1ea7ng tr\xean: \u0111\u01b0a c\u1ea1nh t\u1edbi \u0111\xfang ch\u1ed7 r\u1ed3i ch\xe8n b\u1eb1ng m\u1ed9t trong ba c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ea7u."
e6=A.a([e6,e3?"Edge stuck in the slot, corner in the top layer: use the last two algorithms (d = turn the bottom 2 layers like D).":"C\u1ea1nh k\u1eb9t trong khe, g\xf3c \u1edf t\u1ea7ng tr\xean: d\xf9ng hai c\xf4ng th\u1ee9c cu\u1ed1i (d = xoay 2 l\u1edbp d\u01b0\u1edbi c\xf9ng chi\u1ec1u D)."],s)
